WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:00.885
From a city.

00:01.527 --> 00:06.067
From the middle of a city, only the brightest stars get through, with the planets and the Moon.

00:06.568 --> 00:08.072
The sky itself glows.

00:08.396 --> 00:11.761
Whatever lies behind that glow is still there, every night.

00:12.301 --> 00:13.474
It is only outshone.
